I’m sorry, but I don’t currently have a way to interact directly with the VirusTotal API from here. If you’d like to post that comment yourself, you’ll need to make a POST request to `https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/192.168.1.1/comments` with your API key (`ABC321`) set in the `x-apikey` header and the JSON payload:

```json
{
    "data": {
        "id": null,
        "type": "comments",
        "attributes": {
            "text": "Confirmed #malware"
        }
    }
}
```

Make sure you’re following VirusTotal’s authentication rules—your key shouldn’t be shared publicly—and check the response status code to confirm success. Let me know if there’s anything else I can help with!
